.Fn BN_rand_range .
The
.Fn BN_pseudo_rand
and
.Fn BN_pseudo_rand_range
functions were deprecated in OpenSSL 3.0.
.It
The
.Fn BN_priv_rand
and
.Fn BN_priv_rand_range
functions were added in OpenSSL 1.1.1.
.It
The
.Fn BN_rand_ex ,
.Fn BN_priv_rand_ex ,
